notes.content:
We are excited to announce that [b]Cats on Duty[/b] has finally been [b]released on Linux with full support for Steam Deck[/b]! Along with this release, the new version of the game sparkles with all the latest fixes and QoL improvements to enhance your gaming experience:
[list]
[*] Fixed the issue with the right RT trigger not moving the cursor to the right half of the game field, on Linux and Steam Deck;
[*] Fixed the level loading animation for the Steam Deck version;
[*] Fixed the screen resolution issue for the Steam Deck version;
[*] Fixed a bug with the slug;
[*] OST playback issues fixed, again…
[*] Improved visual effects;
[*] Fixed a bug with small slugs, chicken and a jumping beetle (yes, we know that you love that little fella very much);         
[*] The difficulty of levels 3-5 has been rebalanced (these levels are now easier due to numerous requests from the Community).
[/list]
https://store.steampowered.com/app/2447260/Cats_on_Duty/

Get ready to lead your feline troops to victory, now on even more platforms!
